From: PanVK G615 Migration <panvk-migration@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: preserve the architecture input for viewport varying layouts

Purpose: panvk: preserve the architecture input for viewport varying layouts
Source/Reference: Mesa 13baeb70c066a9f82d2bcfb29f06e4865212affa and the retired JM patch inventory.
Tested GPU: not run for this extracted series (target: Mali-G615).
Tested Kbase UAPI: not run for this extracted series (target: CSF 1.21).
Mesa base range: 27.0.0-devel (13baeb70c066a9f82d2bcfb29f06e4865212affa).
Dependencies: preceding G615 profile patches in scripts/apply-patches.sh.
Validation test: G615 host regressions, strict replay, Android and glibc builds.

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_shader.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_shader.c
index 44a389bdc496f52a31890beda7aefaf8105131a2..549160add8927ea2c43af20915341ac489a58f09 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_shader.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_shader.c
@@ -3559,8 +3559,8 @@
 #if PAN_ARCH >= 10
          if (vp_loc) {
             shader->gpu_prerast.vp_scissor_loc = vp_loc;
-            pan_varying_collect_formats(&vp_layout, nir, inputs.gpu_id);
-            pan_build_varying_layout_compact(&vp_layout, nir, inputs.gpu_id);
+            pan_varying_collect_formats(&vp_layout, nir, inputs.arch);
+            pan_build_varying_layout_compact(&vp_layout, nir, inputs.arch);
             inputs.varying_layout = &vp_layout;
             inputs.skip_viewport_transform = true;
          } else if (v == PANVK_VS_VARIANT_GPU_PASSTHROUGH) {
